title: "Futures Trading: Satellite & Geopolitical Data Connected to Commodity Markets"
abstract: >-
  An open-source data pipeline and interactive dashboard connecting satellite imagery,
  weather data, crop yields, and geopolitical events to commodity futures markets.
  Democratizing Bloomberg Terminal-level data for everyday people.
